- 54/54 official papers and 442/442 questions with one ordered header and a non-empty bounded MS region chain;
- Batch 001: 27 papers / 227 questions, with exact frozen header and region-box zero drift;
- Batch 002: 27 papers / 215 questions, including all 12 legacy 2017 failures repaired;
- preserved partial-v2 file/hash custody and exact compatibility for 113 packets, 113 evidence manifests, and 151 frozen inputs;
- fresh isolated v2, v3, v4, and active v5 packet/bundle validators passing for all 215 questions with complete QP/MS evidence, candidate blindness, exact hashes, and disjoint three-shard ownership;
- zero provider calls, zero candidate-response reads, and zero semantic/canonical/production/public writes.

